# ===========================================================================
#  j2_law99 (J2 plasticity, v1 baseline) - engine deck for post-processing.
#
#  Source: a copy of examples/userlib/j2_law99/test/law99_j2_0001.rad.
#  Model, material, load and timestep settings are all UNCHANGED; only the
#  post-processing output cards marked below were added/changed:
#
#    [ADDED]   /ANIM/VECT/DIS        displacement vectors
#    [ADDED]   /H3D/...              H3D output incl. user state variable
#    [CHANGED] /ANIM/DT TFREQ        0.001 -> 0.0002 (was 2 frames, not an animation)
#
#  Note: local HyperWorks 14 cannot read the H3D (format v24 too new), but it
#  reads the /ANIM A001 files; H3D is for a newer HyperWorks.  The J2 law has
#  NUVAR=1: UVAR(1) = equivalent plastic strain epbar.
# ===========================================================================
/ANIM/DT
#   TSTART     TFREQ
0.0 0.0002
# [ADDED] displacement vectors for HyperView
/ANIM/VECT/DIS
/DT
0.500000 0.000000
/MON/ON
/PARITH/ON
/PRINT/-10/55
/RUN/LAW99_J2/1
0.002
/TFILE/4
#            dT_HIS
0.0005
# [ADDED] H3D output.  USER/UVAR=1 writes the law's state variable 1 (epbar).
/H3D/DT
#   TSTART     TFREQ
0.0 0.0002
/H3D/SOLID/EPSP
/H3D/SOLID/VONM
/H3D/SOLID/DENS
/H3D/SOLID/USER/UVAR=1
1
/VERS/2019
